    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You've linked your lifespan to your bound dragon. Your natural physical aging ceases and you gain the Draconic Vitality action, but your soul grows withered and scabrous by the weight of a dragon's experience with time."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Once per week, from any distance, the dragon can use a free action, which has the concentrate trait, to become "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "6517bbf2-8085-534b-be6a-187d52739fa0"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " for 1 minute. They can use the extra action to Stride, Strike, or to contribute an action to casting a spell. When the dragon uses this ability, you age 10 years and become "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b",
            "label": "Drained 3"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " for 1 hour."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Draconic Vitality",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (concentrate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
